Package: FactoryDaysHours
Type: Package
Title: Fast Business Hours and Business Days Between Timestamps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jesse", "Greever", email = "dr.greever@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Vectorised, closed-form calculation of elapsed working time
    (business hours and business days) between two timestamps, respecting a
    daily working window, weekends and a list of company holidays. Also adds
    working hours to a timestamp. No day-by-day iteration is performed, so
    millions of date pairs are handled in well under a second.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
